# What stays out of the knowledge graph, beyond what .gitignore already excludes
# (Graphify combines both files).
#
# The criterion is not size but whether it answers questions: a regenerable artifact
# or a dependency adds nodes nobody will query and dilutes the ones that matter.

# Third-party, heavy, binary or minified, and says nothing about doction.
app/static/vendor/

# The graph's own output: 7 MB of JSON and HTML describing the graph, not the project.
graphify-out/

# Broader than the single *.log .gitignore excludes.
*.log
